WEBVTT

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:50.580
CROCODINE, THE BEAST KING

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.540
So you're leaving, Dai?

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:53.630
Yeah.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.510
I'm sorry. I'd like to join you,

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:04.010
but if I take a step off this island,
I'll be under the Dark Load's thrall.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:09.810
It's fine, Grampa.
Just wait here with everyone.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.020
I promise I'll defeat the Dark King.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.320
Dai...

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:16.900
Where's Gomechan?

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.360
I wonder...

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:24.030
Maybe hiding somewhere
because saying goodbye is so hard.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.370
I see.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:29.370
How about Popp?

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:36.590
He's still asleep after crying all night.
It must have been quite a shock.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.630
Grampa, take care of Popp, too.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.640
<i>Master! Don't go!</i>

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.350
Don't leave me, Master!

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:53.440
Popp, use what you've learned
to help others.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.280
Master! Don't!

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:00.900
Master Avan!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.750
Master...

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:18.050
Romos Kingdom is the closest.
Head north and go straight.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:21.260
Okay. I'll see King Romos first.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.890
Then I'll head to Papnica.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.430
Watch yourself out there, Dai.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:35.230
Bye everyone! Take care!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.280
Dai!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.900
How dare you!

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.490
Trying to leave me here!

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.450
Popp!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:54.540
Popp...

00:03:55.130 --> 00:04:01.420
D-Don't get the wrong idea!
I'm not going to fight the Dark Army!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:05.050
I just don't want to spend my days
on that island!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.930
Just so we're clear. Got it?

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:12.810
Really?

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.440
Okay! We're off!

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:21.650
<i>We'll be praying for both of you.</i>

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.260
Help!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.420
I was so scared!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.460
Are you okay?

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.050
Thank you.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.130
You're alone?

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.970
I got lost in the woods.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.130
Huh? You're lost?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:31.310
Please, could you take me to my village?

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.270
Um, well, about that...

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:36.480
Please!

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.520
We're actually lost, too.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:40.480
Huh?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.660
This is pathetic! I followed you
because you said you got this!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.200
This place is a lot bigger
than Dermline Island.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:57.960
What are we supposed to do?! We've been
lost for three days since we got here!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.350
What is that?! That weapon's amazing!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.440
Learn to see things through, little Mage.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:26.900
What the hell?! You got a problem
with my magic?! Well?!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:28.740
"Squish"?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.570
What was that for?!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.200
You pervert!

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:36.790
A girl?!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:45.420
Maam!

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:46.510
Mina!

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:51.680
Bad girl. I've told you
never to go into the forest alone!

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:56.060
Mommy was bitten by a Poison Slime.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.310
I came looking for an Antidotal Herb.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.190
You should have come to me.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:04.190
But I'm glad you're all right.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.900
Yeah. They saved me.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:13.120
Thank you very much. I'm Maam.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.870
I live in Nayle Village,
east of this forest.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:22.500
I'm Dai, this is Popp. We're traveling.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.340
You're really strong!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:30.050
You need this sort of equipment
to live near the Dark Forest.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.470
The Dark Forest?

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:37.850
Ever since the Dark Lord returned,
tons of monsters started living here.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.190
It's always been like a maze in here,

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.650
so the people of this country
began calling it the Dark Forest.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:47.110
I see.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:49.280
Where are you two headed?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.070
They said they're lost.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.200
To Romos Palace.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.490
The palace is straight through the forest.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:01.210
But the sun's setting. Why don't you
stay the night in our village?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.380
I'd like to thank you for saving Mina.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:05.920
Really?! That's...

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:07.630
What, Popp?

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.090
Forget that girl. Let's just go.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.760
Huh?! But they'll let us stay.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:14.930
You dummy!

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:19.930
The hospitality of a palace or
a scrawny village? It's not even a debate.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.640
Hey, she might hear.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:23.770
She can hear.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.230
As you've guessed, my village is scrawny.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:32.700
Why don't you hurry and go get
your dinner at the palace?

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.740
Um, he didn't...

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:40.450
After dark, ferocious monsters
start prowling this area.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.290
So you better
get through the forest quick.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.040
With your skills,
you'd probably get eaten.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:49.420
In that case...

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:54.260
Sure! We can get through this brush
without your stupid advice!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.640
Um...

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:06.520
Let's go already, Dai!
Before some scary monsters show up!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.190
Are you sure, Maam?

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.570
Forget about them.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:11.530
Oh?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.820
Did they forget this?

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:20.830
A Slime?

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.700
Ooh! So pretty!

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:24.960
Don't touch it!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.250
Don't be mean to it.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.050
I wasn't...

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:35.920
Come here.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.850
It's so cute!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.100
Those guys...

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.640
What are we supposed to do with this?!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.100
Should we go after them?

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:51.400
After we get you home.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.490
Dammit! That stuck-up...!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.780
I swear I'll get through this forest!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:02.200
Oh man. We should have taken up her offer.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.040
Shut up!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.660
Hurry up!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:09.670
My servant has located Dai.
In the Dark Forest.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.880
I see. They're headed for Romos Castle.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.470
The land of Romos
is Furfang Legion territory.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:20.140
Get me the Legion Commander,
Beast King Crocodine.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.310
<i>Crocodine.</i>

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:31.360
<i>Beast King Crocodine.</i>

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.240
Who's there? What is it?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.860
<i>It is I, Hadlar.</i>

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:43.280
Ah, Sir Dark Commander!
Forgive my rudeness!

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:48.790
<i>What are you doing? I believe
I ordered you to take Romos Kingdom.</i>

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:55.460
That kingdom is worthless. Nothing but
cowards and not a single worthy warrior.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:11:01.510
My Furfang Legion monsters
can take it without my help.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.260
Just give them a few more days.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.970
<i>You haven't changed.</i>

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.480
<i>But that's not why I contacted you.</i>

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:16.230
<i>Someone who would oppose our Dark Army
is lost in the Dark Forest.</i>

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.440
What?! Are they strong?!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.160
<i>This is him. His name is Dai.</i>

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.160
<i>I want you to kill him yourself.</i>

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:29.870
What's so funny?!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:35.540
<i>Surely you jest.
I hold the title of Beast King.</i>

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.460
<i>You would have me fight a child?</i>

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:46.310
Don't underestimate him because he's
a child! He possesses unbelievable power.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:49.060
He even wounded me!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.140
What?!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:56.520
<i>He must be killed before he grows stronger
or he is sure to become a threat!</i>

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.440
Interesting!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:05.700
I'd love to fight a boy
who managed to wound even you!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.080
<i>I'm counting on you.
Make sure he dies.</i>

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.540
AVAN STRASH

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.550
HELL'S CLAW

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.140
H-Huh?

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.350
A dead end?

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.430
We should've asked that girl to guide us.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:36.190
I can't stand stuck-up girls like that!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.820
Then what kind of girls do you like?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:44.240
Well, obviously someone
beautiful, sexy, and rich,

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:47.370
who'll do whatever I say.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.620
Popp, you really are selfish.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.540
What's that voice?!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.460
I sense incredible pressure!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.840
That voice...!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:13.930
It's coming!

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.450
There you are, boy!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.070
A Croc Man?!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.700
I am Beast King Crocodine!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:40.880
FURFANG LEGION, LEGION COMMANDER
BEAST KING CROCODINE

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.710
Legion Commander of one of the

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.920
six legions under Dark Commander Hadlar,

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.590
the Furfang Legion!

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.340
Six legions?!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.550
That's right.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:49.220
The Dark Army is divided into six legions
based on the characteristics of monsters.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.310
<i>The Undead Legion!</i>

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:55.430
<i>A legion of warriors
who have overcome even death itself!</i>

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:57.350
<i>The Blizzblaze Legion!</i>

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:03.070
<i>Destroyers who incinerate all
and freeze even the soul!</i>

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:04.740
<i>The Mystic Legion!</i>

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:09.110
<i>A legion of Mages
who control unparalleled magic!</i>

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.280
<i>The Shadow Legion!</i>

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.830
<i>Dark hunters who kill from the shadows,
unseen and unknown!</i>

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.120
<i>The Dragon Legion!</i>

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.590
<i>A legion of Dragons,
the most powerful of monsters!</i>

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:26.840
And my own Furfang Legion!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:30.010
<i>A pack of fearless beasts!</i>

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:36.350
Dai, by Hadlar's command,
I'm here to kill you!

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:39.650
If you wish to live,
show your true strength.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:44.820
The strength that let you wound
even the Dark Commander himself.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.110
Stuff it, you stupid crocodile!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:53.830
From what you say, you're nothing more
than Hadlar's underling!

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:57.750
Even Hadlar turned tail and ran from us!

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.380
We'll hardly break a sweat with you!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:02.290
Right, Dai?

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.290
Huh?

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.750
<i>But you didn't do anything.</i>

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:14.890
What's so funny?! I could
easily wipe you out with my spells!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:19.270
I don't know who you are,
but go ahead and try.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:21.310
What was that, you bastard?!

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:22.520
Frizz!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.280
With just his breath?!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:36.540
You couldn't kill a Slime with this spell.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:39.870
Now it's my turn!

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.810
<i>Wow! In terms of raw power,
he's stronger than Hadlar!</i>

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:01.730
Don't underestimate us Legion Commanders.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:08.110
In terms of our specialties,
we all surpass Hadlar.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:11.110
That is why we were chosen
as Legion Commanders.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:15.240
Popp, we can't beat him head-on.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:19.750
I'll hit him when he's distracted,
so give me some cover with spells.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:23.330
Popp?

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:25.130
Huh?!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.750
Popp, no way...

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.800
A wise choice! The weakling can run!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:37.810
My orders are to kill only you, Dai!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.680
Here goes!

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.940
Sorry Dai!
Try to find a way to get out of there!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.360
Ow, ow... What the...?

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:57.990
A-An Infanticore?

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:15.720
<i>He's a lot faster than I thought!</i>

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:20.560
What's wrong?
Stop running and fight me!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:23.270
All right! Here goes, Crocodine!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:25.730
What's that stance?

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.600
Avan Style Sword Technique!

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:33.860
Avan? The legendary Hero
who defeated Hadlar.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.490
Avan was my master!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:41.660
I see.
You carry on the will of Avan.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:44.500
So you're a Disciple of Avan!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:45.960
A Disciple of Avan?

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.210
That's right!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.170
Earth Slash!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:50.880
<i>It didn't work?!</i>

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.090
<i>I couldn't even scratch him
with Earth Slash!</i>

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.390
<i>His hide is like steel!</i>

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:06.020
Not bad. But it'll take
more than a knife to hurt me.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:10.110
Now see the might
of a true warrior's weapon!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:15.690
This is Woosh?!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.990
That's right! I myself can't use magic,

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:23.660
but my Vortex Axe
is imbued with Vortex-type magic!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.830
<i>That's right. Master mentioned it.</i>

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:31.840
<i>Legendary weapons that can exhibit
spell effects when used as items!</i>

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.380
Howl! Vortex Axe!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:39.590
Got you!

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:43.640
<i>It's no good!
I can't beat him with strength!</i>

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:48.390
<i>Speed! I'll dodge with speed
and hit him with Wave Slash!</i>

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.730
Die!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:53.360
What?!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.240
C-Curse you!

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:08.870
That's...!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.330
You!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.920
Jump to the side!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:15.500
Jump!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:16.630
Right!

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:29.600
<i>Wow! She's even stronger than me!</i>

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:30.600
Are you okay?!

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.020
Uh, s-sure.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.270
What happened?

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.570
Well, you see,
we were attacked by the Dark Army.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.440
I managed to get away.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:40.360
Where's your friend?

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:42.870
Well, um, you see...

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:46.950
Wait, you're not telling me
you abandoned him?!

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:48.580
No, no, no!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.330
Then explain yourself!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.620
Uh...

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.420
Huh?

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.310
It's like a Frizz spell!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:13.850
<i>With a weapon like this,
she's no ordinary girl!</i>

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:15.810
Huh?

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:24.370
This is a graduation certificate!
An Insignia of Avan!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.280
Then you're also...

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.660
Uh, er, listen, this is...

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:40.630
Bothersome gnat!

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.050
Vortex Axe!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.840
Now!
Avan Style Sword Technique!

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.220
Wave Slash!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.440
It burns!

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.690
Heat Breath. My secret attack.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.780
I'm impressed that
you managed to wound me.

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:07.200
Why can't I move?

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:11.040
That's enough. You fought well.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:15.420
You were far stronger than
any of the veteran warriors I've defeated.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:19.710
It's a shame, but I'll end your suffering.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:20.920
Dai!

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:22.760
Dammit!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.380
You won't stop me!

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.050
Dai! Run!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.970
Why won't he run?!

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:35.810
He's paralyzed!

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:40.650
That's it! Use that weapon and...

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:46.700
Wait! Our enemy is Crocodine!
Where are you aiming?!

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.280
Stop!

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.590
Dai!

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.210
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.210
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.200
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.200
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:38.100
<i>Dai and Crocodine's battle continues
in the Dark Forest.</i>

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:44.150
<i>Watching them fight, Maam remembers
what Avan told her when she was young.</i>

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:51.280
<i>As Dai and Popp head out again to fight,
Maam makes a decision.</i>

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:55.740
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:57.410
<i>"Maam's Turmoil"</i>

00:23:57.950 --> 00:23:59.960
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
